<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <title>Privacy Policy - Pressboxd</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/styles.css">
  <style>
    html, body, body.app { background:#000; }
    .privacyPage { width:min(100%,860px); margin:0 auto; padding:26px 18px 48px; }
    .privacyHeader { padding:12px 0 22px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); margin-bottom:24px; }
    .privacyLogo { display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:18px; }
    .privacyLogo img { display:block; width:auto; height:42px; max-width:220px; object-fit:contain; }
    .privacyHeader h1 { margin:0; font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,42px); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.03em; }
    .privacyEffective { margin-top:8px; color:var(--muted,#a3adbb); font-size:13px; }
    .privacyIntro { margin:0 0 26px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:rgba(255,255,255,.88); }
    .privacySection { padding:22px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09); }
    .privacySection:first-of-type { border-top:0; padding-top:0; }
    .privacySection h2 { margin:0 0 12px; font-size:19px; line-height:1.2; }
    .privacySection p, .privacySection li { color:rgba(255,255,255,.82); font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; }
    .privacySection p { margin:10px 0 0; }
    .privacySection ul { margin:10px 0 0; padding-left:22px; }
    .privacySection li + li { margin-top:5px; }
    .privacySection strong { color:#fff; }
    .privacyContact { border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14); background:#0b0b0b; padding:14px; margin-top:14px; border-radius:0; }
    .privacyContact a { color:var(--accent,#6ea6ff); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
    .privacyBack { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; min-height:36px; padding:7px 10px; margin-top:24px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); border-radius:0; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; background:transparent; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; }
    @media (max-width:600px) {
      .privacyPage { padding:18px 12px 80px; }
      .privacyLogo img { height:32px; }
      .privacyHeader { margin-bottom:18px; padding-bottom:17px; }
      .privacySection { padding:17px 0; }
      .privacySection p, .privacySection li { font-size:13px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="app">
  <main class="privacyPage">
    <header class="privacyHeader">
      <a class="privacyLogo" href="/shows" aria-label="Pressboxd">
        <img src="/static/pressboxd-wordmark.png" alt="Pressboxd">
      </a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="privacyEffective">Effective date: August 31, 2026</div>
    </header>

    <p class="privacyIntro">
      Pressboxd (“Pressboxd,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) respects your privacy.
      This Privacy Policy explains the information we collect, how we use it,
      how it may be shared, and the choices available to you when you use the
      Pressboxd website and mobile application.
    </p>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p><strong>Account information.</strong> If you create an account, we may collect information such as your username, email address, password credentials, profile information, and account settings. Passwords are stored using secure password hashing rather than as readable plain-text passwords.</p>
      <p><strong>Profile information.</strong> You may choose to provide information such as a profile picture, banner image, biography, favorite shows, and other profile customizations.</p>
      <p><strong>User-generated content.</strong> We collect information that you voluntarily submit to Pressboxd, including ratings, reviews, comments, forum posts, replies, predictions, reactions, tier lists, and other community activity.</p>
      <p><strong>Social activity.</strong> We may store information related to followers, following, friendships, favorites, votes, reactions, and interactions with other Pressboxd users.</p>
      <p><strong>Technical and usage information.</strong> When you access Pressboxd, certain technical information may be processed automatically, such as your IP address, browser or device type, operating system, pages accessed, timestamps, session information, and information necessary to operate and secure the service.</p>
      <p><strong>Cookies and session identifiers.</strong> Pressboxd uses cookies or similar technologies to authenticate users, maintain login sessions, remember account information, and provide core functionality.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Create and manage user accounts.</li>
        <li>Authenticate users and maintain login sessions.</li>
        <li>Display profiles and user-generated content.</li>
        <li>Process ratings, reviews, comments, predictions, and other submissions.</li>
        <li>Provide social features such as following, friendships, notifications, and community interactions.</li>
        <li>Personalize and improve the service.</li>
        <li>Maintain, troubleshoot, and secure Pressboxd.</li>
        <li>Prevent abuse, spam, fraud, and unauthorized activity.</li>
        <li>Communicate with users about their accounts or important service-related matters.</li>
        <li>Respond to support, privacy, or legal requests.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>3. Public Information</h2>
      <p>Pressboxd includes public community features. Depending on how you use the service, information such as your username, profile picture, biography, ratings, reviews, favorite shows, forum posts, comments, predictions, followers, following, and other activity may be visible to other users or visitors.</p>
      <p>You should not post sensitive personal information in publicly visible areas of Pressboxd.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>4. How We Share Information</h2>
      <p><strong>Pressboxd does not sell your personal information.</strong></p>
      <p>We may use third-party service providers to help operate Pressboxd, including services for website and application hosting, database or file storage, email delivery, security, and technical infrastructure. These providers may process information only as necessary to perform services on our behalf.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>5. Mobile Application</h2>
      <p>The Pressboxd mobile application may use device functionality necessary to provide features such as network connectivity detection, external browser links, sharing, haptic feedback, application navigation, and status-bar integration.</p>
      <p>Pressboxd does not access your precise location, contacts, SMS messages, camera, or microphone unless a future feature specifically requires that access and appropriate permission is requested.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures intended to protect information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no internet service, database, or electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain account information and user-generated content for as long as reasonably necessary to operate Pressboxd, maintain community features, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, prevent abuse, and enforce our policies.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection" id="account-deletion">
      <h2>8. Account and Data Deletion</h2>
      <p>You may request deletion of your Pressboxd account and associated personal information by contacting us using the email address below. When possible, send the request from the email address associated with your Pressboxd account so that account ownership can be verified.</p>
      <div class="privacyContact">
        <strong>Account deletion requests:</strong><br>
        <a href="mailto:pressboxdcontact@gmail.com">pressboxdcontact@gmail.com</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>9. Children’s Privacy</h2>
      <p>Pressboxd is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we learn that personal information from a child under 13 has been collected, we will take reasonable steps to remove it.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>10. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Pressboxd may contain links to third-party websites or services. Pressboxd is not responsible for the privacy practices, security, or content of third-party services.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>11. Your Privacy Choices</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights concerning your personal information, including the ability to request access, correction, or deletion of information associated with your account.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes to Pressboxd, our practices, legal requirements, or operational needs. When the policy is updated, we may revise the effective date shown at the top of this page.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacySection">
      <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
      <div class="privacyContact">
        <strong>Pressboxd</strong><br>
        Website: <a href="https://www.pressboxd.com">https://www.pressboxd.com</a><br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:pressboxdcontact@gmail.com">pressboxdcontact@gmail.com</a>
      </div>
      <a class="privacyBack" href="/shows">Back to Pressboxd</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
